# NVIDIA driver branches built into the AL2023 GPU AMI as per-version driver trees when nvidia_driver_trees_al2023 is on.
#
# One line per branch: <name> <flavors...>. The first line is the default branch, pinned by nvidia_driver_version_al2023
# like the natively installed driver; every other branch is pinned by nvidia_driver_version_al2023_<name>, both in
# NVIDIA_DRIVER_VERSION. Each branch becomes a tree under /opt/nvidia/<name>. The default branch's kernel modules are
# the native install's, one per flavor listed; every other branch's are built for the flavors listed, which can only be
# open today (the open flavor is all Blackwell and newer GPUs need).
lts open proprietary grid
pb open
